/ All Ages] FIGHTMASTER is the music project of E.R. Fightmaster\, a Queer 
 
artist and advocate who first came into the public eye for their work in tv
 
 and film (Grey?s Anatomy\, Shrill\, Sorry\, Baby.) Sultry and political wi
 
th a healthy dose of humor and retrospection\, FIGHTMASTER?s storytelling t
 
ranscends the personal and shines a unique light on the universal. Their so
 
und is rooted in rock and complimented by lush elements of country\, pop an
 
d funk. In 2024 FIGHTMASTER hit the road on a headlining tour celebrating t
 
heir first two EP?s\, Violence and Bloodshed Baby\, then hit the road again
 
 in 2025 supporting acts like Orla Gartland and The Beaches. 2026 is the ye
 
ar of Tolerance\, FIGHTMASTER?s first full length album. You can see them l
 
ive in May supporting Lucy Dacus\, then headlining a run of East Coast show
 
s\, and again in June\, supporting Lord Huron Tickets & info: https://www.t
 
icketmaster.com/fightmaster-los-angeles-california-10-15-2026/event/090064D
 
7DAF5CCC9
